### 6.1 Automation coverage — Quality assurance gaps
- [ ] **(QA/Eng)** The remaining 10 backend cases with unautomated steps (34 in total). Most common missing steps: "an opportunity with a scored supplier and buyer candidates", "the deal is driven to settlement", "the payout gate amounts in order are …", concurrent approval, ledger-breach fixtures, SSE stream connection.
- [ ] **(QA/Eng)** Link TC-E2E-002 … TC-E2E-010 to LLM journeys with `@journey:` (as TC-E2E-000 is) or rewrite them for the backend runner.
