- [x] **(Eng)** Mandi history backfill from Agmarknet's historical datasets on data.gov.in so the trend works from day one, plus a harvest-month calendar per commodity for the seasonal factor. — done 2026-11-19: `POST /trade-min/mandi/{hs}/backfill` fills 90 days from the historical dataset (`MANDI_HISTORY_RESOURCE_ID`, verify on live data); harvest calendar per commodity (`HARVEST_MONTHS_<COMMODITY>`) → `mandi_trend.season` (harvest / lean / between) even before a week of history.
- [x] **(Eng)** **Annual potential next to one lot** — done 2026-11-17 (market basis): "Profit per year" = margin × min(`reachable_share_pct` 1 % of the market's yearly import tonnes, one lot a month) × chance of closing; sort option "Profit per year".
- [ ] **(Eng)** Annual potential per buyer from its own reorder frequency once import records exist (decision in 12: bill-of-lading data), and from Comtrade monthly data (export-market actor `frequency: "M"`, more actor cost).
- [x] **(Eng)** **Scan cost against profit** — done 2026-11-17: an Apify cost meter (`apify.start_cost_meter`) per corridor scan and per rescore → `EnrichedOpportunity.scan_cost` (runs, USD from `usageTotalUsd`), shown in the market section.

