  - **Rules**: runs monthly. FATF, OECD risk and the sanctions programmes are read directly (see the rule above).
  - **PortLess side**: `COUNTRY_RISK_FEED_URL` / country profiles, plus the ECGC tier suggestion (3.4 "ECGC in the buyer and country checks").
- [ ] **(Apify) P1** A.33 **`import-refusals-ai` (new)** — refusals and alerts against Indian goods.
